text: ['({B/R} can be paid with either {B} or {R}.)\\n{3}{B}, Discard a card: Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.\\n{3}{R}: Create a 2/1 red Goblin creature token with haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.', "Counter target spell, activated ability, or triggered ability. (Mana abilities can't be targeted.)", 'Each creature assigns combat damage equal to its toughness rather than its power.', 'Each other Warrior creature you control enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.\\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has trample.', 'Electrolyze deals 2 damage divided as you choose among one or two targets.\\nDraw a card.', 'First strike, protection from white', 'Flying\\nWhenever you draw a card, Niv-Mizzet, the Firemind deals 1 damage to any target.\\n{T}: Draw a card.', 'Other Elves you control get +1/+1.\\n{G}, {T}: Create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.', 'Trample, haste\\nAt the beginning of the end step, sacrifice Groundbreaker.', "You can't cast this spell during your first, second, or third turns of the game.\\nFlying, vigilance", "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}: Mutavault becomes a 2/2 creature with all creature types until end of turn. It's still a land.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{7}, {T}: Create a 2/2 colorless Assembly-Worker artifact creature token.']
